'''Newtown Trench''' (ニュータウン海淵, ''Nyūtaun Kaien'', '''Newtown Trench Depths''') is the 19th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 117th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty. The gimmick of this sub-chapter is similar to [[Truth in Extremes]] in that every three stages play out alike, but with different variants of each enemy.

==Difficulty==
This subchapter only has one decently hard stage in [[Jetsam Lookout]], which can get chaotic very quickly. Every other stage here is either solved with simple luring or spamming midrangers until you win.

