==Trivia==
*Newtown may be a pun on ''Newton'', as in [[wikipedia:Isaac Newton|Isaac Newton]], foreshadowing the Newton-inspired boss and [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] in the next sub-chapter, [[Truth's Devouring Maw]].
*[[Floating Bus Stop]] and [[Ink Museum]] are designed like late [[Stories of Legend]] stages, [[Coral Housing]] and [[Kelp Campsite]] are designed like [[Uncanny Legends]] stages, and [[Renovated Shipwreck]] and [[Jetsam Lookout]] are typical [[Zero Legends]] stages.
*[[Sir Metal Seal]], [[Imperator Sael]] and [[Sir Seal]] are the only enemies in Newtown Trench that do not have the [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] type nor a variant with the Sage type.

